WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.105
Compliance is a running record, not a form you fill once.

00:00:04.105 --> 00:00:08.930
Every observation is an entry with a date, a location and a status.

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:14.381
Add one from the field. What you saw, where, how serious, with a photo.

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:17.055
It is in the record the moment you save.

00:00:17.963 --> 00:00:21.689
An agency walks the site. The visit is its own record.

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:24.795
Who came, what they saw, what they asked for.

00:00:24.795 --> 00:00:31.143
One tap writes the summary into the daily log, and the running visit log exports on its own.

00:00:31.857 --> 00:00:36.357
A spill gets the same treatment. What was released, how much, and where.

00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:45.107
The record asks what the incident form asks, runs the reportability test for your state, and keeps a timed log of who you notified and when.

00:00:45.819 --> 00:00:48.616
Open items are your to do list on the site.

00:00:48.616 --> 00:00:51.867
Add one, give it a due date, and it will find you.

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:54.599
Resolve it with a note. The history stays.
